OL,3,GNEWSASchool uniform costs hit families,
OL,4,Asay charities
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities in Sussex have warned new
OL,7,Fschool uniform costs could add
OL,8,Ffinancial pressure on struggling
OL,9,Ffamilies.
OL,11,FThis is despite new rules limiting the
OL,12,Fnumber of branded items state schools
OL,13,Fcan require, which the government says
OL,14,Fwill save parents money.
OL,16,FChildren's charity Pelican Parcels, in
OL,17,FBrighton and Hove, said it was set to
OL,18,Fdouble its school uniform support by
OL,19,Fthe end of 2026 in response to "rising
OL,20,Flocal demand".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
