OL,3,GNEWSASchool uniform costs hit families,
OL,4,Asay charities
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Every child deserves to start the
OL,7,Fschool year feeling confident, with
OL,8,Fschool uniform and shoes that fit
OL,9,Fproperly," said head of operations
OL,10,FElaine Bailey. "For many families, the
OL,11,Fcost of uniform can be overwhelming."
